cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
title: "scadbatch: batch export models from parametric OpenSCAD designs"
abstract: >-
  Batch export models from parametric OpenSCAD designs using CSV or Customizer JSON parameter
  sets. Exports any format OpenSCAD supports, runs cases in parallel, and records a
  machine-readable summary of each run.
type: software
authors:
